Callback transaction with a deferred closure on the named result (rollback error joined, commit error wrapped).
Expect Begin's errors (TimeoutError, ErrBusy, lock errors) behind "tx: begin: %w", ctx.Err() bare, fn's errors
(execute's set, via the closure in Service.Transfer) bare and behind errors.Join together with rollback errors
(repo.ErrTxDone behind "tx: rollback: %w"), and commit errors behind "tx: commit: %w".
-- args --
-fanout=2 tx/tx.go:@withtx
